        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HYp3yu3E1mepZpYLNjuZSwl7A6w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17116-pineapple-glaze-for-ham-DDMFS-218-step-02-3d45013ffcea41ce886d9a01913ae45b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17116/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine brown sugar and reserved pineapple juice in a medium microwave-safe bowl. Mix and microwave for about 5 minutes, until mixture is thick.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/34KnjG6TeqA8LJulW7WNzKWlHbg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17116-pineapple-glaze-for-ham-DDMFS-224-step-04-b31e4b69d82d4578958674772e5c062d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17116/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour some of this glaze over the ham about every 15 minutes in the last hour of baking, until all is used.",
